OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Multi-cancer' blood tests coming to
OL,4,Asome GP surgeries soon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tests look for proteins or
OL,7,Ffragments of DNA in the blood that may
OL,8,Fsignal cancer. Results could help
OL,9,Fdoctors decide which patients with
OL,10,Fvague symptoms need further
OL,11,Finvestigations.
OL,13,FMore than 20,000 patients aged 45 and
OL,14,Fover with symptoms such as pain or
OL,15,Fpersistent bloating will be eligible to
OL,16,Ftake part.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
