OL,3,ABinance says fake job interviews used
OL,4,Aas part of $6.3bn crypto hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHackers who stole a record $6.3bn
OL,7,F(#4.7bn) from Binance used fake job
OL,8,Finterviews and a compromised internal
OL,9,FAI tool, the firm has revealed.
OL,11,FInitial findings published by the
OL,12,Fcompany, which operates the world's
OL,13,Flargest cryptocurrency exchange, said
OL,14,Fhackers gained access to its systems
OL,15,Fthrough "sophisticated, multi-stage
OL,16,Fcampaign".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
